00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:23.940
because he couldn't be any worse than the one we know.

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:26.720
Yes, Beaver, maybe we should.

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:52.540
Dad, hey, look at all the lights.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:54.860
