00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:10.120
Wally, Eddie's father told me

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:12.700
that Eddie's kind of nervous about being alone.

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:14.550
That's why he has all the lights on.

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:18.500
Oh. You know what?

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:20.630
