00:17:33.640 --> 00:17:36.320
Sure hates to have to clobber him right on his own front porch.

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:55.200
Who's there?

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:57.020
It's me, Eddie Wally.

00:17:58.670 --> 00:17:59.970
Talk to you, you miserable r...

