Uh, it's just kind of a little gag we play on each other.

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:05.690
I turn the lights out on him while he's reading,

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:08.390
and then he turns the lights out on me while I'm doing homework.

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:10.310
We have a lot of laughs that way.

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:17.200
Good evening, Mrs. Cleaver.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:20.250
Well, hello, Eddie. We're glad you decided to come back.

00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:23.150
Thank you. I thought it was the mature thing to do.

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:28.170
Yes, well, um, I think you boys better be getting ready for bed.

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:29.560
